<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Team Members</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: Arial; background: #f7f9fc; margin: 0; }
  .team {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 40px;
  }
  .card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    width: 280px;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: 0.3s;
  }
  .card:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }
  .lead {
    background: #e3f2fd;
    border: 2px solid #2196f3;
  }
  @media (max-width:600px){
    .team { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="team">
    <div class="card lead">
      <h3>Ravi Sharma</h3>
      <h4>Team Lead</h4>
      <p>Guides the team and ensures timely project completion.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Asha Singh</h3>
      <h4>Designer</h4>
      <p>Creates beautiful and functional designs for users.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Mohit Verma</h3>
      <h4>Developer</h4>
      <p>Builds and maintains the web applications.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
